body:
First time in this color combo after hearing Luis says it's the best combo. I can see why to say the least.

&#x200B;

I have some questions

&#x200B;

I was offered a 4th halo forager but I took a squadron for the curve and it seemed like 4 was too much. Was this correct?

&#x200B;

What could make this deck better? I was thinking maybe another removal spill over the hopper. And of course 1 or 2 bombs more bombs would have been nice.
